## Market Snapshot — Wednesday, May 13, 2026

**Bottom line:** Tape is bifurcating sharply. Semis are ripping on the back of Huang's surprise inclusion in the Trump-Xi delegation, but the broader market is wrestling with a genuinely problematic macro setup — hot CPI and a 6% YoY PPI print (largest in three years), oil back above $100 on the Iran war, and the 10Y yield at a 10-month high of 4.49%. Risk-on internals masking a real shift in the rate-cut narrative.

